(setter_touchoff_z -- zero Z on the workpiece and calibrate the setter)
(Jog down to the workpiece top, then run this instead of AXIS Touch Off:)
(  o<setter_touchoff_z> call)
(It sets Z zero here, then drives to the setter and measures D, so a later)
(tool change only needs o<setter_zero> call.)

o<setter_touchoff_z> sub

  G10 L20 P0 Z0

  o<setter_cal> call

o<setter_touchoff_z> endsub
